        89.46791076660156
      ],
      "text": "A5.4 A survey to explore the programmatic feasibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.472900390625,
        467.7181396484375,
        112.26789855957031
      ],
      "text": "of levofloxacin (Lfx) TPT for MDR-TB contacts 11",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        120.88151550292969,
        151.89718627929688,
        139.15151977539062
      ],
      "text": "Introduction",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        145.85743713378906,
        527.4465942382812,
        160.30043029785156
      ],
      "text": "The survey assessed the feasibility of programmatic use of Lfx for TPT among contacts of MDR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.0574493408203,
        527.4135131835938,
        173.5004425048828
      ],
      "text": "patients in the eventuality of a WHO recommendation for its programmatic use. The objective was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.25746154785156,
        527.4376220703125,
        186.70045471191406
      ],
      "text": "to collect perspectives from national TB programmes (NTPs), explore current practices for MDR TPT,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.4574737548828,
        527.437744140625,
        199.9004669189453
      ],
      "text": "its programmatic feasibility, affordability, impact on equity, acceptability to patients and health-care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        198.6573028564453,
        527.4418334960938,
        213.1002960205078
      ],
      "text": "workers and to inform the discussion of WHO Guideline group at its meeting on 4–6 December 2023.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985390663146973,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        223.52403259277344,
        129.24095153808594,
        241.79403686523438
      ],
      "text": "Methods",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.2358856201172,
        527.4429321289062,
        262.9429016113281
      ],
      "text": "Sampling and recruitment strategy:  Purposive sampling of NTP managers in 30 countries listed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        261.69989013671875,
        527.5133056640625,
        276.1429138183594
      ],
      "text": "by the WHO as having the highest burden of MDR-TB who were contacted from publicly listed e-mail",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983237266540527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.89990234375,
        527.438720703125,
        289.3429260253906
      ],
      "text": "addresses. 18 programme managers responded within the expected timeline, comprising three in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.09979248046875,
        527.4095458984375,
        302.5428161621094
      ],
      "text": "the WHO African Region, two in the South-East Asia Region, seven in the European Region, one in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        301.2999267578125,
        527.4124755859375,
        315.7429504394531
      ],
      "text": "the Eastern Mediterranean Region, and five in the Western Pacific Region. The perspectives of NTP",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        314.49993896484375,
        526.1693725585938,
        328.9429626464844
      ],
      "text": "managers were collected on a self-administered, short-answer survey questionnaire sent by e-mail.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        339.36651611328125,
        117.78335571289062,
        357.63653564453125
      ],
      "text": "Results",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        364.07843017578125,
        527.4050903320312,
        378.7854309082031
      ],
      "text": "Current practice in use of MDR TPT among contacts of DR/MDR-TB patients:  Seven (39%) of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.966599464416504,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        377.54241943359375,
        527.5358276367188,
        391.9854431152344
      ],
      "text": "18 NTP managers reported use of 6Lfx for MDR-TB contacts, although in two countries use was limited",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.956765174865723,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        390.7424011230469,
        527.4343872070312,
        405.1854248046875
      ],
      "text": "due to high background resistance to FQs. One respondent each reported use of 9-month Lfx as a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        403.9424133300781,
        524.3742065429688,
        418.38543701171875
      ],
      "text": "part of a two-drug regimen with either ethionamide or prothionamide as a companion drug, high-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        417.1424255371094,
        527.4404907226562,
        431.58544921875
      ],
      "text": "dose INH and either 6-month standard dose INH or 3 months of once-weekly INH and rifapentine.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        430.3424377441406,
        527.3761596679688,
        444.78546142578125
      ],
      "text": "Three (17%) did not specify the TPT regimen being used. Eight (44%) respondents reported no use",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.5424499511719,
        272.6534423828125,
        457.9854736328125
      ],
      "text": "of TPT for contacts of DR/MDR-TB patients.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.9823303222656,
        527.1732177734375,
        479.6893310546875
      ],
      "text": "Affordability:  Respondents were informed about the estimated cost of providing 6Lfx at the Global",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.995949745178223,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        478.4463195800781,
        527.424560546875,
        492.88934326171875
      ],
      "text": "Drug Facility price per treatment course (approximately US$ 18.50, as compared with 6H at US$ 3.50",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        491.64630126953125,
        527.4478149414062,
        506.08935546875
      ],
      "text": "Most respondents considered 6Lfx to be affordable. Nine (50%) stated that it  and 9H at US$ 5.25).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.8463134765625,
        527.5106811523438,
        519.289306640625
      ],
      "text": "would be affordable for all ages, three (17%) that it would be affordable only for HHCs < 15 years and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977577209472656,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        518.0462646484375,
        527.532958984375,
        532.4892578125
      ],
      "text": "one (6%) only for HHCs < 5 years. Three (17%) respondents stated that 6Lfx would not be affordable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999199867248535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.246337890625,
        402.71142578125,
        545.6893310546875
      ],
      "text": "and two (11%) that it would depend on the availability of donor funding.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.6863403320312,
        527.429931640625,
        567.1953125
      ],
      "text": "Programmatic feasibility (additional resources required, distribution, training, timeline):",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        566.1502685546875,
        527.3945922851562,
        580.59326171875
      ],
      "text": "Nine (50%) of the 18 respondents suggested that the cost and the availability of additional resources",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.350341796875,
        527.5684814453125,
        593.7933349609375
      ],
      "text": "would not be barriers to implementation, while seven (39%) considered that additional funding would",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976625442504883,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.55029296875,
        527.5108032226562,
        606.9932861328125
      ],
      "text": "be necessary for expansion of drug-susceptibility testing, contact screening, monitoring and follow-up",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965746879577637,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.7503051757812,
        527.4189453125,
        620.1932983398438
      ],
      "text": "for individuals started on TPT. Five (28%) respondents noted that implementation of 6Lfx TPT would",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.9503173828125,
        527.4520874023438,
        633.393310546875
      ],
      "text": "divert resources from other services and called for proactive planning. All the managers stated that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.1502685546875,
        527.43212890625,
        646.59326171875
      ],
      "text": "logistics management for Lfx would be sustainable. Nine (50%) managers stated that no training or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.3502807617188,
        527.3861083984375,
        659.7932739257812
      ],
      "text": "< 12 h of additional training would be required for health-care workers, and four (22%) respondents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.55029296875,
        294.2222595214844,
        672.9932861328125
      ],
      "text": "said that >  12 h of training would be necessary.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        680.2542114257812,
        527.5906982421875,
        694.6972045898438
      ],
      "text": "With regards to the timeline for nationwide scaling up of 6Lfx TPT, nine (50%) respondents estimated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998899459838867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        693.4542236328125,
        527.5531616210938,
        707.897216796875
      ],
      "text": "that it would take <3 years and one (6%) stated >3 years. The others either did not provide information",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.951543807983398,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.6541748046875,
        527.408935546875,
        721.09716796875
      ],
      "text": "or were unsure. Acceptability to health-care workers was generally anticipated to be high, five (28%)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.8541870117188,
        527.4299926757812,
        734.2971801757812
      ],
      "text": "respondents expected health-care workers to remain neutral, some expressed concern about fear",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        749.8717041015625,
        526.602294921875,
        763.57568359375
      ],
      "text": "Harsimren Sidhu, Dick Menzies (McGill International TB Centre & WHO Collaborating Centre in TB Research, Montreal Chest Institute  11",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        762.6716918945312,
        268.8805847167969,
        773.1756591796875
      ],
      "text": "and Research Institute of McGill University health centre)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        349.7414855957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.0995483398438,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Annex 5. Summary of unpublished studies (PICO 10) 245",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}